        "description": "Nice is the independent-thinking partner in the \"Hamatora\" detective agency. His partner is Murasaki. He is a minimum holder, his powers involve sound. In the anime, this power is called \"Sonic Minimum\", but in the manga it's called \"Cannon Ball Minimum\".\n\n~!He also has a second minimum ability, the \"Ego Minimum\", which he got from the heart transplant from Art's little brother; Skill. The trigger for this minimum is hope and it has the power to amplify the ego of individuals, resulting in the birth of one's minimum, or give a person's ego back.!~",
